 & L2 (LeWM) & \underline{56.0} $\pm$ 3.8 & 34.4 $\pm$ 3.2 & 35.6 $\pm$ 1.5 & 16.4 $\pm$ 1.5 \\
 & Ours & \textbf{62.0} $\pm$ 4.7 & \textbf{49.6} $\pm$ 4.6 & \textbf{50.4} $\pm$ 3.2 & \textbf{27.6} $\pm$ 6.1 \\
