\paragraph{Compute.} \Cref{tab:compute} reports preparation and planning cost; parameter counts
are in \cref{tab:params}. Both learned additions are small next to the frozen encoder and
predictor (18.03M): the TDR net used at planning time is 0.64M and the five-member critic 4.13M.
The Dijkstra pass runs once per goal, not per candidate. Together, they add 58\% to the planning time, with respect to L2. 

