A related question concerns the planner itself: how far ahead should the L2 baseline plan
before replanning? \Cref{tab:replan-frequency-appendix} varies the plan length over 5 steps (a
single action block), 25 steps (the default), 50 and 100 steps. The CEM horizon is set equal to
the executed chunk in every case, so the planner executes exactly the span it evaluated. Budgets,
tasks and seeds follow \cref{tab:main}.

\begin{table}[h]
\centering\small
